// Monotone periodic cubic through keypoints (no overshoot, flat at peaks and troughs).
function curve(kp){const P=kp.map(([t,v])=>[((t%1)+1)%1,v]).sort((a,b)=>a[0]-b[0]),n=P.length;
const E=[[P[n-2][0]-1,P[n-2][1]],[P[n-1][0]-1,P[n-1][1]],...P,[P[0][0]+1,P[0][1]],[P[1][0]+1,P[1][1]]];
const m=E.map((_,k)=>{if(k===0||k===E.length-1)return 0;const h0=E[k][0]-E[k-1][0],h1=E[k+1][0]-E[k][0],d0=(E[k][1]-E[k-1][1])/h0,d1=(E[k+1][1]-E[k][1])/h1;return d0*d1<=0?0:3*(h0+h1)/((2*h1+h0)/d0+(h1+2*h0)/d1);});
return t=>{t=((t%1)+1)%1;let k=1;while(k<E.length-2&&E[k+1][0]<=t)k++;const [t0,v0]=E[k],[t1,v1]=E[k+1],h=t1-t0,s=(t-t0)/h,s2=s*s,s3=s2*s;return(2*s3-3*s2+1)*v0+(s3-2*s2+s)*h*m[k]+(-2*s3+3*s2)*v1+(s3-s2)*h*m[k+1];};}
const mix=(a,b,s)=>a.map((p,i)=>[p[0]+(b[i][0]-p[0])*s,p[1]+(b[i][1]-p[1])*s]);
const PCWP_DELAY=.06,REF_DELAY=.03;
// Returns pressure functions of phase plus the keypoint times of the atrial waves.
export function hemoModel(disease='normal',sev=1){const D=SEV[disease]||{},s=disease==='normal'?0:sev,kp={};
for(const k of Object.keys(N))kp[k]=D[k]?mix(N[k],D[k],s):N[k];
const f={};for(const k of Object.keys(kp))f[k]=curve(kp[k]);
const laMean=mean(f.LA);
const P={RA:f.RA,RV:f.RV,PA:f.PA,LA:f.LA,PCWP:t=>laMean+.9*(f.LA(t-PCWP_DELAY)-laMean),LV:f.LV,AO:f.AO,
LVOT:disease==='hocm'?t=>Math.min(f.LV(t),f.AO(t)+3):f.LV,AOREF:t=>f.AO(t-REF_DELAY)};
const waves=k=>{const a=kp[k==='PCWP'?'LA':k],d=k==='PCWP'?PCWP_DELAY:0;return{a:a[2][0]+d,c:a[4][0]+d,x:a[5][0]+d,v:a[6][0]+d,y:a[7][0]+d};};
return{P,waves,co:5+((D.co??5)-5)*s};}
export function mean(fn,a=0,b=1,n=400){let s=0;for(let i=0;i<n;i++)s+=fn(a+(b-a)*(i+.5)/n);return s/n;}
export function extrema(fn,a=0,b=1,n=400){let lo=Infinity,hi=-Infinity,tl=a,th=a;for(let i=0;i<=n;i++){const t=a+(b-a)*i/n,v=fn(t);if(v<lo){lo=v;tl=t;}if(v>hi){hi=v;th=t;}}return{lo,hi,tl,th};}
// Teaching numbers derived from the curves.
export function hemoNumbers(m){const {P}=m,r=v=>Math.round(v);
const ra=m.waves('RA'),pw=m.waves('PCWP');
const out={RA:{a:r(P.RA(ra.a)),v:r(P.RA(ra.v)),m:r(mean(P.RA))},RV:{s:r(extrema(P.RV).hi),ed:r(P.RV(.27))},PA:{s:r(extrema(P.PA).hi),d:r(P.PA(.335)),m:r(mean(P.PA))},
PCWP:{a:r(P.PCWP(pw.a)),v:r(P.PCWP(pw.v)),m:r(mean(P.PCWP))},LV:{s:r(extrema(P.LV).hi),ed:r(P.LV(.27))},LVOT:{s:r(extrema(P.LVOT).hi),ed:r(P.LVOT(.27))},
AO:{s:r(extrema(P.AO).hi),d:r(P.AO(.335)),m:r(mean(P.AO)),pp:r(extrema(P.AO).hi-P.AO(.335))},co:m.co};
const ej=t=>P.LV(t)-P.AO(t);let pk=0,sum=0,n=0;for(let i=0;i<=200;i++){const t=.335+.2*i/200,g=ej(t);pk=Math.max(pk,g);if(g>0){sum+=g;n++;}}
out.lvAo={p2p:Math.max(0,r(extrema(P.LV).hi-extrema(P.AO).hi)),peak:r(pk),mean:r(n?sum/n:0)};
const lvotAo={peak:0};for(let i=0;i<=200;i++){const t=.335+.2*i/200;lvotAo.peak=Math.max(lvotAo.peak,P.LVOT(t)-P.AO(t));}out.lvotAo={peak:r(lvotAo.peak)};
let ds=0,dn=0;for(let i=0;i<200;i++){const t=.66+.6*i/200;ds+=P.PCWP(t)-P.LV(t);dn++;}out.msGrad=Math.max(0,r(ds/dn));
out.tpg=out.PA.m-out.PCWP.m;out.dpg=out.PA.d-out.PCWP.m;out.pvr=Math.round(out.tpg/m.co*10)/10;return out;}
